From: JustTV contributors
Subject: [PATCH] freetype: use stdio font loading instead of Unix mmap metadata

Avoid FreeType's Unix mmap implementation, which fstats automatically selected
system fonts. Meson's disabled mmap option selects the portable stdio loader.
This narrows one metadata path; it does not qualify the entire SDK's privacy use.
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later (VLC contrib recipe modification).

--- a/contrib/src/freetype2/rules.mak
+++ b/contrib/src/freetype2/rules.mak
@@ -28,7 +28,7 @@
 DEPS_freetype2 = zlib $(DEPS_zlib)
 
 FREETYPE_CONF := -Dpng=disabled -Dbzip2=disabled -Dharfbuzz=disabled \
-                 -Dbrotli=disabled
+                 -Dbrotli=disabled -Dmmap=disabled
 
 .freetype2: freetype crossfile.meson
 ifndef AD_CLAUSES
